{
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "AttributionCategory": {
        "description": "归因类别。**取值必须与 `attributions.category` 的 CHECK 逐字一致。**\n\n两边不一致的后果不是报错，而是\"某条归因写不进去\"——且只在跑到那一步时\n才暴露（与 `RunPhase` 同理）。",
        "enum": [
          "request_invalid",
          "auth_error",
          "resource_not_found",
          "conflict",
          "rate_limited",
          "server_error",
          "response_schema_mismatch",
          "assertion_mismatch",
          "network_error",
          "blocked_by_policy",
          "unknown"
        ],
        "title": "AttributionCategory",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "AttributionItem": {
        "description": "一条失败归因。**机器结论与人工表态在同一条里**。\n\n两者并存而不是分成两个接口：用户看归因时关心的就是\"机器判了什么、\n我同意不同意\"——拆开会让他先拉一次列表、再拉一次表态。",
        "properties": {
          "attribution_id": {
            "title": "Attribution Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "case_id": {
            "title": "Case Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "case_name": {
            "title": "Case Name",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "category": {
            "title": "Category",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "confidence": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Confidence"
          },
          "dimension": {
            "title": "Dimension",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "evidence": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "type": "object"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Evidence"
          },
          "http_status": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Http Status"
          },
          "human_category": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Human Category"
          },
          "human_verdict": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "enum": [
                  "agree",
                  "disagree"
                ],
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Human Verdict"
          },
          "llm_model": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Llm Model"
          },
          "method": {
            "enum": [
              "rule",
              "llm"
            ],
            "title": "Method",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "rule_ref": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Rule Ref"
          },
          "status": {
            "title": "Status",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "attribution_id",
          "case_id",
          "case_name",
          "dimension",
          "status",
          "category",
          "method"
        ],
        "title": "AttributionItem",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "AttributionListResponse": {
        "description": "归因列表（分页）。分页约定与 `CaseListResponse` 一致。",
        "properties": {
          "items": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AttributionItem"
            },
            "title": "Items",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "limit": {
            "title": "Limit",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "offset": {
            "title": "Offset",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "run_id": {
            "title": "Run Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "total": {
            "title": "Total",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "run_id",
          "total",
          "limit",
          "offset"
        ],
        "title": "AttributionListResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "CaseListItem": {
        "description": "确认界面里的一条用例。\n\n## 为什么把 `assertions` 也带出来\n\n确认界面的**全部意义**就是让人看\"这条用例到底要断言什么\"。只给名字与\n维度的话，用户只能凭标题猜——而标题是自然语言，断言是结构化数据，\n两者可以不一致（模型写了个像样的标题配一条错的断言）。\n\n代价是响应体更大，而一页只有 50 条、每条几条断言——可以接受。\n\n⚠️ `request_headers` / `request_body` **刻意不带**：前者可能含凭证\n（SR-6），后者的信息量对\"要不要批准\"这个判断几乎没有帮助。\n需要看请求体的场景应当通过 `GET /api/runs/{id}/report` 的失败清单\n去定位具体问题，而不是把 2000 条用例的请求体塞进列表接口。",
        "properties": {
          "assertions": {
            "items": {
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "type": "object"
            },
            "title": "Assertions",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "case_id": {
            "title": "Case Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "category": {
            "enum": [
              "normal",
              "abnormal",
              "boundary"
            ],
            "title": "Category",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "confidence": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "enum": [
                  "high",
                  "low"
                ],
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Confidence"
          },
          "dimension": {
            "title": "Dimension",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "is_destructive": {
            "title": "Is Destructive",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "name": {
            "title": "Name",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "request_method": {
            "title": "Request Method",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "request_path": {
            "title": "Request Path",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "review_status": {
            "enum": [
              "pending",
              "approved",
              "rejected"
            ],
            "title": "Review Status",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "case_id",
          "name",
          "category",
          "dimension",
          "review_status",
          "is_destructive",
          "request_method",
          "request_path"
        ],
        "title": "CaseListItem",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "CaseListResponse": {
        "description": "用例列表（分页）。\n\n`total` 与 `items` 的长度**不是一回事**：前者是全部用例数，\n后者是这一页的数量。少了 `total`，前端就没法显示\"共 N 条\"\n或做\"最后一页\"的判断。",
        "properties": {
          "items": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CaseListItem"
            },
            "title": "Items",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "limit": {
            "title": "Limit",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "offset": {
            "title": "Offset",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "run_id": {
            "title": "Run Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "total": {
            "title": "Total",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "run_id",
          "total",
          "limit",
          "offset"
        ],
        "title": "CaseListResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "CreateRunRequest": {
        "properties": {
          "spec_id": {
            "title": "Spec Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "spec_id"
        ],
        "title": "CreateRunRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "DecisionApplied": {
        "description": "本次实际生效的条数。**回显计数而不是只说\"成功\"。**\n\n用户提交了 118 条的决策，界面上回一个 `{\"ok\": true}` 是没用的——\n他要确认的是\"我批的 40 条真的批了\"。数字对不上时立刻能发现。",
        "properties": {
          "approved": {
            "title": "Approved",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "rejected": {
            "title": "Rejected",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "approved",
          "rejected"
        ],
        "title": "DecisionApplied",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "DecisionItem": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "一条人工决策。\n\n`decision` 用 `Literal` 而不是 `str`：拼错的值（`\"approved\"`、\n`\"Approve\"`）必须在**边界上**被拒绝，而不是落库之后变成一个\n`CHECK` 约束报错——那时用户看到的是 500，而真正的原因是他拼错了。",
        "properties": {
          "case_id": {
            "title": "Case Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "decision": {
            "enum": [
              "approve",
              "reject"
            ],
            "title": "Decision",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "case_id",
          "decision"
        ],
        "title": "DecisionItem",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "DecisionRequest": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "IP-1 的决策提交（`05` §4.5）。\n\n## 为什么**必须完整**（所有 pending 用例都要出现）\n\n部分提交会让图带着\"还有未决用例\"的状态恢复，而 IP-1 的语义是\n\"人已经看过了\"。允许部分提交，就等于允许\"没被提到的用例保持 pending\"\n——而它们**既不会被执行，也不会出现在报告里**，用户以为默认是放行。",
        "properties": {
          "decisions": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DecisionItem"
            },
            "title": "Decisions",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "decisions"
        ],
        "title": "DecisionRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "DecisionResponse": {
        "description": "决策已生效。\n\n**200 而不是 202**（M2 的决定）：决策落库是同步且权威的——返回之前\n`review_status` 已经提交，用户的决定**已经生效**。202 的\"已受理、\n尚未处理\"语义反而不对：resume 的投递是内部细节，且失败可恢复\n（投递幂等 + 兜底轮询），不该让它把\"已生效\"降格成\"已受理\"。",
        "properties": {
          "applied": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DecisionApplied"
          },
          "run_id": {
            "title": "Run Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "run_id",
          "applied"
        ],
        "title": "DecisionResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "HTTPValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"
            },
            "title": "Detail",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "title": "HTTPValidationError",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "HealthResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "const": "ok",
            "title": "Status",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "status"
        ],
        "title": "HealthResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "HumanVerdictRequest": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "人工对一条归因表态（LA §8）。\n\n`human_category` 的**必填性取决于 verdict**，所以不在这里用 Pydantic\n校验——那样返回的是 FastAPI 默认错误体，而契约要求 `problem+json`\n与可区分的 `code`（LA6）。校验放在路由里。",
        "properties": {
          "human_category": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AttributionCategory"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "verdict": {
            "enum": [
              "agree",
              "disagree"
            ],
            "title": "Verdict",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "verdict"
        ],
        "title": "HumanVerdictRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ReadinessCheck": {
        "description": "一项依赖的连通性。`detail` 只放异常类型，不放异常消息。",
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Detail"
          },
          "name": {
            "title": "Name",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "ok": {
            "title": "Ok",
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "name",
          "ok"
        ],
        "title": "ReadinessCheck",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ReadinessResponse": {
        "description": "`GET /readyz` 的响应。\n\n与 `/healthz` 的分工：\n`/healthz` 只回答\"进程活着\"（不碰任何依赖），\n`/readyz` 回答\"现在能不能干活\"（会碰 PG 与 Redis）。",
        "properties": {
          "checks": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReadinessCheck"
            },
            "title": "Checks",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "status": {
            "enum": [
              "ok",
              "degraded"
            ],
            "title": "Status",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "status",
          "checks"
        ],
        "title": "ReadinessResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "RunCreatedResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "phase": {
            "title": "Phase",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "run_id": {
            "title": "Run Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "run_id",
          "phase"
        ],
        "title": "RunCreatedResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "RunStatusResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "expected_case_count": {
            "title": "Expected Case Count",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "failure_reason": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Failure Reason"
          },
          "interrupt": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "type": "object"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Interrupt"
          },
          "phase": {
            "title": "Phase",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "run_id": {
            "title": "Run Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "settled_case_count": {
            "title": "Settled Case Count",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "spec_fingerprint": {
            "title": "Spec Fingerprint",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "run_id",
          "phase",
          "spec_fingerprint",
          "expected_case_count",
          "settled_case_count"
        ],
        "title": "RunStatusResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SpecCreatedResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "declared_targets": {
            "description": "从 servers 提取的出站目标，值为 `scheme://host:port`。为空意味着所有请求都会被 Guardrail 拒绝。",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "title": "Declared Targets",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "fingerprint": {
            "title": "Fingerprint",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "openapi_version": {
            "title": "Openapi Version",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "operation_count": {
            "title": "Operation Count",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "reused": {
            "description": "指纹命中已有 Spec 时为 true——**没有重新解析、没有重复落库**",
            "title": "Reused",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "spec_id": {
            "title": "Spec Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "warnings": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WarningItem"
            },
            "title": "Warnings",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "spec_id",
          "fingerprint",
          "openapi_version",
          "operation_count",
          "declared_targets",
          "reused"
        ],
        "title": "SpecCreatedResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "ctx": {
            "title": "Context",
            "type": "object"
          },
          "input": {
            "title": "Input"
          },
          "loc": {
            "items": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              ]
            },
            "title": "Location",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "msg": {
            "title": "Message",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": {
            "title": "Error Type",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "loc",
          "msg",
          "type"
        ],
        "title": "ValidationError",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "WarningItem": {
        "description": "解析期间的降级提示（`05` §4.1）。\n\n**不可省略**：`SpecParser` 的降级情形（相对 URL、无 `servers`、`$ref` 超深）\n必须在这里告知用户——否则用户后续看到 `blocked_by_policy` 归因时，\n会以为是平台故障，而真正的原因在解析阶段就被掩盖了。",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "description": "机器可读的提示码，如 `relative_server_url`",
            "title": "Code",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "detail": {
            "description": "给人读的说明",
            "title": "Detail",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "code",
          "detail"
        ],
        "title": "WarningItem",
        "type": "object"
      }
    }
  },
  "info": {
    "description": "基于多智能体编排的 API 自动化测试平台。\n\n**接口契约以代码为准**（ADR-0023）：这份文档由 FastAPI 从路由与 Pydantic 模型自动生成，`openapi.json` 是它的产物而非来源。",
    "title": "TestFlow",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "paths": {
    "/api/runs": {
      "post": {
        "description": "创建 Run 并投递推进指令。\n\n**503 而不是静默成功**：队列不可用时返回 503（`05` §4.2）。\n返回 202 而实际什么都没投递，会让用户等一个永远不会开始的 Run——\n那比\"明确失败\"糟得多。",
        "operationId": "create_run_api_runs_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "authorization",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "Authorization"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateRunRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RunCreatedResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "summary": "发起一次测试运行",
        "tags": [
          "runs"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/runs/{run_id}": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "get_run_api_runs__run_id__get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "run_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "title": "Run Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "authorization",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "Authorization"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RunStatusResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "summary": "查询运行状态",
        "tags": [
          "runs"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/runs/{run_id}/attributions": {
      "get": {
        "description": "列出某个 Run 的归因。分页约定与 `/cases` 一致。\n\n**一次批量取用例与结果**，不逐条查——一页最多 500 条，\n逐条查就是 1500 次往返（归因 + 用例 + 结果）。",
        "operationId": "list_attributions_api_runs__run_id__attributions_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "run_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "title": "Run Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "limit",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": 50,
              "maximum": 500,
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Limit",
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "offset",
            "required": false,
